harness · `v8/` patch, reduced cases, analysis · `learned/` GNN and adaptive policy · `federated/` ·
`infra/` signing/encryption/mTLS · `viz/` browser view · `bench/` runners, statistics, plots, claims · `paper/` · `results/`
